@startuml
title ASENT — Repository CI/CD Activity (SABLE Branch)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
start
:GitHub event;
fork
if (CI trigger matches?) then (yes)
  :Install locked Python dependencies;
  fork
    :Lint and high severity Bandit scan;
  fork again
    :Module test matrix;
  fork again
    :Full integration test suite;
  fork again
    :Frontend checks and render tests;
  end fork
  :Upload JUnit reports;
endif
fork again
if (SABLE shared workflow trigger?) then (yes)
  :Run focused SABLE and shared-gate tests;
endif
fork again
if (CD trigger matches master, v* tag, or manual dispatch?) then (yes)
  :Build and publish container image to GHCR;
  :Smoke test published image;
  if (v* tag?) then (yes)
    :Build frontend release bundle;
    :Create GitHub Release with source and frontend archives;
  endif
endif
end fork
:Report matching workflow outcomes;
stop
note right
Workflow definitions represented here are ci.yml,
sable-shared.yml, and cd.yml on the current SABLE branch.
The report PDF workflow belongs to a separate report worktree
and is intentionally outside this branch-scoped view.
end note
@enduml
